{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A catastrophe has struck a small southern town \u2013 a viral outbreak occurred at a laboratory of a popular pharmaceutical company. Authorities tried to contain the situation, but failed, and the virus quickly spiraled out of control. The infected broke free, plunging the city into chaos. The dead began to rise, swelling the ranks of zombies, and the epidemic spread rapidly to neighboring regions. Only the fight for survival offers a chance not to become one of them.<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>From The Bunker</i>, you become the leader of a group of survivors who\u2019ve managed to find shelter during the zombie apocalypse. But your problems don\u2019t end here: you must defend your bunker against waves of the infected, raiders, and other threats. You\u2019ll need to manage scarce resources wisely, explore the world around you, scavenge vital supplies, and build relationships with fellow survivors. You decide who gets to enter the bunker and who is left outside. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the ruined world and scavenge for valuable resources:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The disaster changed everything \u2013 now each day is a fight for survival. Venture beyond the bunker to find weapons, medicine, supplies, and other crucial resources. Explore ruined streets, abandoned shops, and military depots, but be careful: lurking in the shadows are not only zombies, but desperate people willing to do anything to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/extras/57be21a5f1a8afb2610e292aeba3f3cd.poster.avif?t=1770824449\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/extras/57be21a5f1a8afb2610e292aeba3f3cd.webm?t=1770824449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/extras/57be21a5f1a8afb2610e292aeba3f3cd.mp4?t=1770824449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, craft, and fortify your bunker against enemies:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bunker is your last hope. Upgrade it, strengthen its defenses, build new structures and workstations. Construct a generator for electricity, upgrade the boiler for clean water, build barricades, and set traps to protect yourself from infected attacks and looters.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/extras/e035b3f122f75142e30b657b5bb0c1f3.poster.avif?t=1770824449\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/extras/e035b3f122f75142e30b657b5bb0c1f3.webm?t=1770824449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/extras/e035b3f122f75142e30b657b5bb0c1f3.mp4?t=1770824449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make decisions that can change everything:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day is a new challenge. Who will you allow into the bunker? Who will you leave behind? Will you share your supplies with allies or keep them for your own team? Your choices shape the survivors\u2019 fate, affect their morale, and determine their willingness to fight. Any decision could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/extras/85909a6315f6951da69810669a07955d.poster.avif?t=1770824449\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/extras/85909a6315f6951da69810669a07955d.webm?t=1770824449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/extras/85909a6315f6951da69810669a07955d.mp4?t=1770824449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight for survival, every blow could be your last:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the bullets run out, anything you can get your hands on becomes a weapon. Use melee weapons, the environment, and tactical tricks to survive zombie encounters. Manage your survivors based on their strengths, but remember: their physical and mental conditions directly influence the outcome of battles. One wrong move, and death is unavoidable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/extras/4e3e966d489e8fd84670e7136789b533.poster.avif?t=1770824449\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/extras/4e3e966d489e8fd84670e7136789b533.webm?t=1770824449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/extras/4e3e966d489e8fd84670e7136789b533.mp4?t=1770824449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1782590?t=1770824449","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770824449","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/4b4abcab33a2419b36b193b60609fe5a38132436/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770824449","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/4b4abcab33a2419b36b193b60609fe5a38132436/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770824449","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of violence and cruelty, including:\r\n\r\nPhysical violence: Scenes where characters may be subjected to physical harm, including fights and other forms of aggression.\r\n\r\nPsychological pressure: Situations where characters experience stress, fear, or other intense emotions due to unfolding events.\r\n\r\nIt is important to note that all violent scenes are driven by player choice and the logical progression of the story within a post-apocalyptic setting. The game does not contain sexual content or scenes of sexual violence."},"detailed_description":"<h1>WISHLIST</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/extras/6fad1f1ccea343c47ef802d24faa1756.avif?t=1770824449\" width=1280 height=400 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A catastrophe has struck a small southern town \u2013 a viral outbreak occurred at a laboratory of a popular pharmaceutical company. Authorities tried to contain the situation, but failed, and the virus quickly spiraled out of control. The infected broke free, plunging the city into chaos. The dead began to rise, swelling the ranks of zombies, and the epidemic spread rapidly to neighboring regions. Only the fight for survival offers a chance not to become one of them.<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>From The Bunker</i>, you become the leader of a group of survivors who\u2019ve managed to find shelter during the zombie apocalypse. But your problems don\u2019t end here: you must defend your bunker against waves of the infected, raiders, and other threats. You\u2019ll need to manage scarce resources wisely, explore the world around you, scavenge vital supplies, and build relationships with fellow survivors. You decide who gets to enter the bunker and who is left outside. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the ruined world and scavenge for valuable resources:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The disaster changed everything \u2013 now each day is a fight for survival. Venture beyond the bunker to find weapons, medicine, supplies, and other crucial resources. Explore ruined streets, abandoned shops, and military depots, but be careful: lurking in the shadows are not only zombies, but desperate people willing to do anything to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/extras/57be21a5f1a8afb2610e292aeba3f3cd.poster.avif?t=1770824449\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/extras/57be21a5f1a8afb2610e292aeba3f3cd.webm?t=1770824449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/extras/57be21a5f1a8afb2610e292aeba3f3cd.mp4?t=1770824449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, craft, and fortify your bunker against enemies:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bunker is your last hope. Upgrade it, strengthen its defenses, build new structures and workstations. Construct a generator for electricity, upgrade the boiler for clean water, build barricades, and set traps to protect yourself from infected attacks and looters.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782590/extras/e035b3f122f75142e30b657b5bb0c1f3.poster.avif?t=1770824449\" wi